  "\"$0 today\" means \"all of it later, plus late fees if you slip\". If you can't afford it now, you usually can't afford it in instalments either.": "“今天$0”的意思是“以后全部要付，晚了还要加罚款”。如果你现在买不起，分期通常也一样买不起。",
