  "Bro, every book-out you're busy. I panic when you don't reply for an hour. Also, Bali trip? Only $680. Let's go next month!": "兄弟，你每次放假都很忙。你一个小时不回我，我就慌了。还有，巴厘岛旅行？才$680。下个月一起去吧！",
  "Haziq misses you. Your wallet does not miss Bali.": "哈齐克想你了。你的钱包可不想巴厘岛。",
