  "Book-out dinner. Mei wants to give Mum and Dad a monthly allowance. {her}: \"And later, would you want a flat near your parents? Or mine?\"": "放假出营的晚餐。小美想每个月给爸妈零用钱。{her}：“以后，你会想住在你爸妈附近的组屋吗？还是我爸妈附近？”",
